<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">EU-Agent-Bench: Measuring Illegal Behavior of LLM Agents Under EU Law</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Ilija Lichkovski
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>AI Safety Initiative Groningen
</span>
